  "question": {
    "text": "Time period of a simple pendulum in a stationary lift is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>. If the lift accelerates with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> vertically upwards then the time period will be<br />(Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo></math> acceleration due to gravity)"
  },
